<div class="page-heading"><div><h1>Recommendations</h1><p class="muted">Evidence-backed opportunities and catalog fixes, ordered by priority.</p></div><span class="badge neutral"><%= @recommendations.count %> open</span></div>
<section class="card"><% @recommendations.each do |rec| %><%= render "shopify/app/recommendation", recommendation: rec %><% end %><% if @recommendations.blank? %><div class="empty"><h2>No action needed</h2><p>Sellora has no open recommendations for this store.</p></div><% end %></section>
<p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem">Sellora opens the relevant Shopify Admin screen for real changes. Review product facts, margins, and campaign fit before saving.</p>
